version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
abstract: >-
  A browser-only metadata editor for DDI-Codebook 2.6, supporting simple and
  comprehensive entry modes, live XML/JSON preview, import, export, and
  structural XML validation against the bundled DDI-Codebook schema.
keywords:
  - DDI-Codebook
  - metadata
  - social science data
